    "answer_zh": "症状：开关门中途走停或反弹（§八遇阻红外·非motor won't function · 非zero power to motor · 非lock still unlocks ET24 · 非worked four days · 非opens too far into grass limit · 非bypassed motor limit switch jumping wires）\n症状：开关门中途走停或反弹（§八遇阻红外·非motor won't function · 非zero power to motor · 非lock still unlocks ET24 · 非worked four days · 非opens too far into grass limit）\n1 排除红外遇阻影响\n2 断电调遇阻缓停止\n3 打开离合，手放拉耳处，去推拉门看看是否顺畅\n4 机臂从门上拿下来试试按遥控器的时候机臂能否正常伸缩\n5 还不行发视频\n如果上面步骤还不行，可以考虑测电压，和转拉耳180°的排查\n如果机臂不带门也伸出一点就反弹，其他已排除，客人不能测电机电流：\n可以让客户把离合打开，按遥控器看看电机有没有问题，如果没问题，那么也很有可能机臂存在某个卡点。如果离合打开电机还有问题，可以做测电机，如果此时电机可以正常运行，那控制板可能有故障了。",
    "answer_en": "1 If the photocell is used, please ensure the photocell sensor beam is not blocked. Clear any objects blocking the photocell sensor. Check if the photocell sensor is defective and properly installed. If the photocell is not used, please set the switch #3 to OFF to disable the photocell sensor function.\n2 Turn off the power to the gate opener (disconnect the power source from the +BAT- terminals), then locate FORCE Potentiometer on the control board and turn it slightly clockwise to increase the stall force. Then locate SOFT STOP Potentiometer and turn it slightly counterclockwise to decrease the soft stop time. After adjusting, turn on the power to the gate opener and press the remote control to open and close the gate through a full cycle. Press the remote again to see if the gate opener works better in the next cycle.\n3 Use the release key to disengage the clutch of the arm, and check whether the gate can be manually opened & closed freely 3.3 feet (one meter) away from the gate hinge. If not, please double check the installation and gate itself to ensure it can move freely by hand. Lubricate the arm and the gate including the hinge if necessary. If there is still no help,please do the following test.\n4 Please take down the arm from the gate and hold its front mount, then press the remote to see if the arm can extend and retract properly each time. If the arm can run normally in this case, the arm is fine. The problem might be from the cooperation between the gate opener and the gate. Please let me know the length and weight of your gate.\n5 Please shoot some videos showing the performance of the arms when you do the test for further judgement. You can directly send the video to my E-mail via the attachment. If the sending is not successful, please share the photo or video link through dropbox, icloud or google drive. Thanks for your understanding and cooperation.\n1 Please detect the voltage of the +BAT- (11#, 12#) terminals on the control board after pressing the remote to see whether the voltage can stay at almost 24V (above 22V). If the voltage is fine, please do the following tests.  （一般情况走停需要监测电压是否压降，反弹不需要）\n2 If the arm and gate are fine, please rotate the front mount 180 degrees to try again.\n1 Use the release key to disengage the clutch.\n2 Press the remote button to check if the motor runs continuously in one direction. You may need to listen to the motor sound to confirm. Press the remote again to stop the motor, then press one more time to test if it runs normally in the opposite direction.\nIf the motor runs normally in both directions, please manually extend and retract the arm (with the clutch still disengaged) to check for any difficulty in movement.\nIf the motor cannot run continuously, you can check the motor. Keep the clutch released, connect the red & black wires of the arm to the DC 24V power source directly, the motor should run, and then exchange the polarity of the wires, the motor should run in the opposite direction. If the motor runs normally in both directions, the motor itself is good and the control board is likely faulty.",
